 'Sean says yes to the 10 lesson pictures for the Food Photographer Guide (list in the ve-front-of-house playbook, 2026-11-21 record); then make them with the locked scene recipe and show the set before they go in.',
 '["Sean: yes to the 10 lesson pictures", "Sean: pay per shoot for photographers (recommend flat $150 per 8-dish shoot)", "Then: remove the Preview banner, Kai''s lines approved and recorded, rewrite the job, outreach last (our creators, Ambassadors, members, colleges)", "From 1012, still open: v9 agreement and lawyer service; Managed keeps the 15-dish shoot, photo nights, ad allowance; pace rule; V''s three line changes; check-ins every two weeks; phone recordings for tour frames 5, 14, 17, 22"]'::jsonb,
